-# Aetherion Quests — German pre-pre-beta language pack
-# Missing keys fall back to English. Quests & hints only.
+# Aetherion Quests — German language pack (overlay)
+# English in Java is the canonical voice sheet. This file only swaps wording:
+# same facts, same gates, same rewards. Missing keys fall back to English,
+# except cast.* (ambient voice): no German entry = that NPC stays quiet for DE readers.
+#
+# Sections
+#   ui / progress / msg   short UI strings (ui.talk_ux.* = bubble chips + quest card, ui.tip.* = action bars)
+#   quests.<id>           quest card title + description
+#   dialogs.<dialogId>    NPC intros (nested keys = state variants picked in code)
+#   completed.<npcId>     chatter after the NPC's quest is done (nested = variants)
+#   talk.<npc>.<key>      inline turn-in / brief / redirect lines
+#   cast.<npcId>.*        CastBook voice: chips, reactions, return visits, greetings, barks, topics
+#   banter                NPC-to-NPC scripts, same order and speakers as CastBook
+#
+# Proper nouns stay as the game shows them (Ore Ridge, Shabby Mine, Recipe Book, Anvil,
+# Catch Sphere, Quartermaster …) so speech matches nametags, menus and the compass.
+# Rite Warden / Proctor (Borderlands rites) keep their existing lines — owned by the Hub pass.
 
